  "prefLabel": "Fors 105.02 Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 105.02 Quorum. A quorum of the board shall consist a majority of the members approved by the governor and council and a majority vote by the quorum shall be necessary to pass a motion. In the absence of chair, vice chair, or secretary, the chair shall designate a pro tempore officer for the officer or officers absent.\n\nSource. #6915, eff 12-22-98; ss by #13583, eff 5-20-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fors100-500.html"
